# public tree. They stay tracked here: this repository is the working repo.
# scripts/check-neutral.sh scans exactly what is NOT export-ignored.
# Each directory is listed twice: `dir` drops it from `git archive`, `dir/**`
# makes `git check-attr` report every file inside it as well.

